  m_text: 'The VoiceController will instantiate in runtime the necessary elements
    in order for the voice to work for the configuration selected.


    In the case
    of Dissonance for Mirror (ENABLE_DISSONANCE_MIRROR), we have to use for the PlayerConnection
    of the NetworkManager of Mirror a special one that includes the components "MirrorIgnorancePlayer"
    and "VoiceBroadcasterTrigger".


    This text will be destroyed in runtime.
    DO NOT DESTROY THIS MESSAGE so anyone can read this instructions.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
